{"sha":"898215cb89fcd1baccfc1af167a67c66f0488060","node_id":"C_kwDOQ07FcNoAKDg5ODIxNWNiODlmY2QxYmFjY2ZjMWFmMTY3YTY3YzY2ZjA0ODgwNjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/commits/898215cb89fcd1baccfc1af167a67c66f0488060","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/commit/898215cb89fcd1baccfc1af167a67c66f0488060","author":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-16T00:34:56Z"},"committer":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-16T00:34:56Z"},"tree":{"sha":"090453919073b264f112e31ae4c6732a12b3c588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/trees/090453919073b264f112e31ae4c6732a12b3c588"},"message":"perf(eval): count canonical string bytes incrementally\n\nProblem: Recomputing Buffer.byteLength over each accumulated decoded string made the capped 64 KiB path quadratic.\n\nDecision: Collect decoded scalars in chunks, count each scalar UTF-8 width incrementally, and join once when the closing quote is reached.\n\nRationale: This keeps bounded byte accounting while preserving the exact limit check point and scalar refusal behavior.\n\nValidation: Independent static review CLEAR; node --experimental-strip-types --check passed for the modified source; git diff --check passed. Full parity qualification follows after commit.","parents":[{"sha":"7887369bfaab514fa498f76d9bf9c157377c802a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/commits/7887369bfaab514fa498f76d9bf9c157377c802a","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/commit/7887369bfaab514fa498f76d9bf9c157377c802a"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}}